{"4183000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Legion", "steam_appid": 4183000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Legion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTS-RPG Hybrid | Tactical Shooter | Base Building &amp; Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 Core Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Our defeat is merely preparation for the next victory.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Legion</i> is a hardcore Shooter-RTS-RPG hybrid. After the initial raid by the Vex Corps nearly annihilated human civilization, players step into the boots of an embattled Commander. Starting from a crumbling base, you must execute a desperate counterattack against the AI antagonists, leveraging tactical deployment, soldier development and upgrades, and a sophisticated technology tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💡 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desperate Survival &amp; Base Reconstruction (Base Building &amp; RTS Elements)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth of a Shattered Base:</strong> Begin with a destroyed Command Center. Unlock and construct vital buildings, including Barracks, R&amp;D Labs, Factories, and Defense turrets. Every resource is critically scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource and Defense Management:</strong> Deploy barricades, Sentry Turrets, and Armored Tanks to fend off the Vex Corps' relentless retaliations. In an environment of extreme scarcity, you must delicately balance offensive power and defensive expenditure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RTS-RPG Hybrid Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad-Based Tactical Shooting:</strong> From a third-person perspective, the player directly controls a small number of elite combat units. Execute surgical strike missions by combining precise movement, timely skill activation, and environmental interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎙️ Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are developing <i>The Last Legion</i> to immerse players in a battlefield completely dominated by their wit and decisions. This is more than just a shooting war; it is a profound struggle of will, technology, and humanity. The Vex Corps are formidable adversaries, and they <i>will</i> make you pay a price for your resistance. But persist, and you can become the Commander who achieves the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your Wishlist Today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of humanity rests in your hands. Commander, rally your legion and prepare for a war you have yet to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming Faction System for greater support and allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded Ammunition Systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Vehicle Options to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization of Enemy AI.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Legion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTS-RPG Hybrid | Tactical Shooter | Base Building &amp; Defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💥 Core Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Our defeat is merely preparation for the next victory.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Legion</i> is a hardcore Shooter-RTS-RPG hybrid. After the initial raid by the Vex Corps nearly annihilated human civilization, players step into the boots of an embattled Commander. Starting from a crumbling base, you must execute a desperate counterattack against the AI antagonists, leveraging tactical deployment, soldier development and upgrades, and a sophisticated technology tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💡 Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desperate Survival &amp; Base Reconstruction (Base Building &amp; RTS Elements)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth of a Shattered Base:</strong> Begin with a destroyed Command Center. Unlock and construct vital buildings, including Barracks, R&amp;D Labs, Factories, and Defense turrets. Every resource is critically scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource and Defense Management:</strong> Deploy barricades, Sentry Turrets, and Armored Tanks to fend off the Vex Corps' relentless retaliations. In an environment of extreme scarcity, you must delicately balance offensive power and defensive expenditure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RTS-RPG Hybrid Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad-Based Tactical Shooting:</strong> From a third-person perspective, the player directly controls a small number of elite combat units. Execute surgical strike missions by combining precise movement, timely skill activation, and environmental interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎙️ Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are developing <i>The Last Legion</i> to immerse players in a battlefield completely dominated by their wit and decisions. This is more than just a shooting war; it is a profound struggle of will, technology, and humanity. The Vex Corps are formidable adversaries, and they <i>will</i> make you pay a price for your resistance. But persist, and you can become the Commander who achieves the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your Wishlist Today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of humanity rests in your hands. Commander, rally your legion and prepare for a war you have yet to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upcoming Faction System for greater support and allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded Ammunition Systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Vehicle Options to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization of Enemy AI.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Last Legion is an RTS-RPG hybrid shooter that combines Real-Time Strategy, Role-Playing, and Base Building elements. The core gameplay centers on Desperate Survival and Base Reconstruction: you must unlock and build barracks, R&amp;D facilities, and defenses.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183000/cc21b32f6e220147368dab0778cddc7278d26147/header.jpg?t=1780949673", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183000/9fc42dd3344c5fe77b49c462c4049472509f24ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780949673", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183000/9fc42dd3344c5fe77b49c462c4049472509f24ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780949673", "website": 